{
  "about": "Gold set B: the 100 papers drawn in docs/gold-set-b-sample.json, which Europe PMC links to no Cancer Research UK grant. Two passes of a Claude model proposed the labels against the written guide (#3) and the rules agreed with the owner, and the owner checked them (#175). The owner checked 58 papers: the 18 that settled the rules, the 30 where the passes differed or one was unsure, and 10 of the other 52 drawn at random with seed 20261109. That sample found no error, so the other 42 were accepted as proposed. The owner changed 0 of the 100 labels. Each paper lists its grant references, normalised, or none. Ids and references only, never text.",
